        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(“Datavault,” the “Company,” “us,” “our,” or “we”) is a pioneering technology licensing company that owns a portfolio of patented, secure platforms designed to redefine how data is managed, valued, and monetized in the modern era.",
        "start_character": 46,
        "end_character": 276
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031280",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031280-e90508adca4ecf70",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031280",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our Data Sciences division will redefine data management by providing a software as a service (“SaaS”) platform designed to enable organizations to acquire, value, refine, and monetize their data assets with unparalleled security and control.",
        "start_character": 1100,
        "end_character": 1353
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031280",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031280-e90508adca4ecf70",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031280",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, we cannot guarantee that we will be able to secure trademark registrations or enforce exclusive rights in all jurisdictions in which we operate or seek to expand.",
        "start_character": 22169,
        "end_character": 22340
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031280",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031280-e90508adca4ecf70",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031280",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to these core technology stacks, we are developing and protecting intellectual property in several emerging technology categories that extend the commercialization potential of our technology platforms:",
        "start_character": 25136,
        "end_character": 25350
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031280",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-031280-e90508adca4ecf70",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-031280",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In certain countries in which we operate, we are subject to, and comply with, local labor law requirements.",
        "start_character": 19846,
        "end_character": 19953
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-031280",
