        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Concurrently, we are committed to scaling our direct sales efforts to penetrate key verticals—such as biotechnology, fintech, hospitality, and advertising—capitalizing on our first-mover advantages and robust patent portfolios.",
